#: templates/admin/importer-page.php:54
msgid "An import writes real members, spaces, posts and messages into BuddyNext. It never duplicates on a re-run, but it cannot be undone from here - reversing it means restoring a backup. Copy your site to staging, migrate there, check the result with the migration checks below, and only then repeat it on production."
msgstr ""

